  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3be3048eed6de9b48a1a9ab3da6b5b67, type: 3}
  m_Name: TyrantHoverTank
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Tyrant Hover-tank
  role: 2
  description: 'A dagger-shaped Draconis hover-tank flown by a Kobold pilot. Its
    Tyrant Railgun (5 damage, penetration 7, 50 m, once a turn) punches through any
    armor in the game for 150% damage, and it has 100% accuracy. It glides 30 m a
    move, and terrain can''t slow it (Hover): hills, water and climbing onto obstacles
    cost it nothing extra, though it still has to go around anything that blocks
    its way. Being Mechanical it can''t sprint. With 15 health and Armor Level 4
    it shrugs off small arms, and when destroyed it has a 10% chance to explode (Unstable).
    Heavy Support, so you can field more than one.'
  leader: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ebe61b12d5ceb5c479d708e3e99f6010, type: 2}
